#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1
msgid "Coupling Workflows"
msgstr "耦合工作流"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:3
msgid "RELIC coupling is implemented through `ScaleCouplingFunctor` and the existing state, parameter, port, and orchestration contracts. Internal domain exchange, temporal scaling, spatial regridding, external model adapters, and plugin coupling use separate interfaces but converge on the same runtime lifecycle."
msgstr "RELIC coupling is implemented through `ScaleCouplingFunctor` and the existing state， parameter， port， and orchestration contracts. Internal domain exchange， temporal scaling， spatial regridding， external model adapters， and plugin coupling use separate interfaces but converge on the same runtime lifecycle."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:8
msgid "Built-in internal coupling"
msgstr "内置内部耦合"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Coupling type"
msgstr "耦合类型"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`biosphere_atmosphere`"
msgstr "`biosphere_atmosphere`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Exchange declared biosphere and atmosphere variables through the built-in coupling contract."
msgstr "通过内置的耦合契约交换声明的生物圈和大气变量。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`soil_vegetation`"
msgstr "`soil_vegetation`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Evaluate Feddes root-water uptake from a resolved soil profile and expose `root_uptake_profile` (kg m-3 s-1) and `effective_transpiration` (kg m-2 s-1) as replace-mode rate ports. It does not advance or deduct soil moisture; a soil-water budget closes only when a registered soil-water Functor consumes the port exactly once, and no current soil-water Functor does."
msgstr "根据已解析的土壤剖面计算 Feddes 根系吸水，并将 `root_uptake_profile`（kg m-3 s-1）和 `effective_transpiration`（kg m-2 s-1）作为替换模式的速率端口暴露出来。它不推进也不扣减土壤水分；只有当某个已注册的土壤水 Functor 恰好消费该端口一次时，土壤水收支才闭合，而目前没有任何土壤水 Functor 这样做。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:32
msgid "These are the built-in types returned when plugin coupling is excluded. Unknown types raise `ValueError`. Default configurations are read from the parameter database; missing required entries raise `KeyError` or `RuntimeError`."
msgstr "这是排除插件耦合时返回的内置类型。未知类型引发`ValueError`。默认配置从参数数据库中读取；缺少必需项引发`KeyError`或`RuntimeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:46
msgid "`name` becomes the registered Functor identity. `config` contains the coupling-specific contract and parameter references. `parameter_manager` allows explicit manager injection; otherwise the canonical global manager is used by the coupling factory."
msgstr "`name`成为注册的Functor身份。`config`包含耦合特定的契约和参数引用。`parameter_manager`允许显式管理器注入；否则，耦合工厂使用规范全局管理器。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:51
msgid "Temporal scaling"
msgstr "时间缩放"

