msgstr "含义"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`source_frequency`"
msgstr "`source_frequency`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Frequency token of the source series: `sub-hourly`, `hourly`, `daily`, `weekly`, `monthly`, `seasonal`, or `annual`, optionally with an integer multiplier such as `3hourly`. Tokens are matched without regard to case; `yearly` is accepted for `annual`, and `subhourly`, `sub_hourly`, `minute`, `minutes`, `min`, `mins`, `minutely`, `second`, `seconds`, `sec`, `secs`, and `secondly` for `sub-hourly`."
msgstr "源序列的频率标记：`sub-hourly`、`hourly`、`daily`、`weekly`、`monthly`、`seasonal` 或 `annual`，可带整数倍数，例如 `3hourly`。匹配不区分大小写；`yearly` 可替代 `annual`，`subhourly`、`sub_hourly`、`minute`、`minutes`、`min`、`mins`、`minutely`、`second`、`seconds`、`sec`、`secs` 和 `secondly` 可替代 `sub-hourly`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`target_frequency`"
msgstr "`target_frequency`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Frequency token of the target series."
msgstr "目标序列的频率标记。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`direction`"
msgstr "`direction`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`UPSCALE` for fine-to-coarse or `DOWNSCALE` for coarse-to-fine. `TemporalAggregator` requires `UPSCALE`. `TemporalDisaggregator.disaggregate()`, `downscale()`, `to_hourly()`, `to_daily()`, and `forward()` require `DOWNSCALE`, and `TemporalDisaggregator.upscale()` requires `UPSCALE`. A mismatch raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "由细到粗用 `UPSCALE`，由粗到细用 `DOWNSCALE`。`TemporalAggregator` 要求 `UPSCALE`。`TemporalDisaggregator.disaggregate()`、`downscale()`、`to_hourly()`、`to_daily()` 和 `forward()` 要求 `DOWNSCALE`，而 `TemporalDisaggregator.upscale()` 要求 `UPSCALE`。不匹配时抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`spatial_basis`"
msgstr "`spatial_basis`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Spatial representation of the mapped field: a `SpatialQuantityBasis` (`intensive`, `cell_total`, `area_density`, or `categorical`) or its string value. It never selects the temporal law; the temporal operators use it only to reject `categorical` fields, which raise in aggregation and disaggregation. The string `extensive` raises `ValueError` because it does not say whether a value is a cell total or an area density."
msgstr "映射场的空间表示：`SpatialQuantityBasis`（`intensive`、`cell_total`、`area_density` 或 `categorical`）或其字符串值。它不选择时间映射律；时间算子仅用它拒绝 `categorical` 场，这类场在聚合和解聚时都会报错。字符串 `extensive` 会抛出 `ValueError`，因为它未说明数值是单元总量还是面积密度。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`temporal_semantics`"
msgstr "`temporal_semantics`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Explicit `interval_mean`, `rate`, `interval_accumulation`, or `state_at_boundary`; a call-level value takes precedence. Missing semantics are rejected without inference, and `point_sample` and `categorical` are rejected."
msgstr "显式指定 `interval_mean`、`rate`、`interval_accumulation` 或 `state_at_boundary`，调用级传入值优先级最高。缺失时间语义时直接拒绝且不作隐式推断；`point_sample` 与 `categorical` 同样直接拒绝。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`conservation_level`"
msgstr "`conservation_level`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`none`, `relaxed`, `moderate`, or `strict`; see \"Coverage, residuals, and errors\" below."
msgstr "`none`、`relaxed`、`moderate` 或 `strict`；参见下文“覆盖率、残差与错误”。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`conservation_level_overrides`"
msgstr "`conservation_level_overrides`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Immutable normalized overrides keyed by exact Functor identity."
msgstr "以精确 Functor 标识为键的不可变、已归一化 override。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`device`"
msgstr "`device`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Optional initial tensor device; simulator registration owns final migration."
msgstr "tensor设备可选；模拟器注册最终迁移"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:79
msgid "The constructor normalizes the enum fields, parses `spatial_basis` with `SpatialQuantityBasis.parse`, and freezes the normalized per-Functor conservation overrides. It validates the frequency tokens but stores them as given: `TemporalConfig(\"hourly\", \"yearly\").target_frequency` is `\"yearly\"`. An unknown frequency token raises `ValueError`. The valid-coverage threshold is not a configuration field. Its only owner is the parameter `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold` (declared bounds [0.5, 1.0]; current configuration: 0.8), which `TemporalAggregator` reads through ParameterManager when it is constructed; the aggregator also rejects a value outside `(0, 1]`. The resolved value is the read-only property `coverage_threshold`: assigning it raises `AttributeError`, so a different threshold for one aggregator is set on that parameter (the global ParameterManager or an injected `parameter_manager`) before construction, where it is validated. The configuration does not accept `cf_compliant` or establish complete dataset-level Climate and Forecast (CF) conformance. Runtime interval bounds, calendar, units, temporal semantics, and coverage are checked by the temporal operation."
msgstr "构造器会规范化各枚举字段，通过 `SpatialQuantityBasis.parse` 解析 `spatial_basis`，并冻结规范化后的逐 Functor 守恒覆盖项。构造器会校验频率标识但按原样存储：`TemporalConfig(\"hourly\", \"yearly\").target_frequency` 的值为 `\"yearly\"`；未知频率标识抛出 `ValueError`。有效覆盖率阈值不属于配置字段，其唯一归属为参数 `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold`（声明边界为 [0.5, 1.0]，当前配置值为 0.8），由 `TemporalAggregator` 在构造阶段通过参数管理器（ParameterManager）读取；聚合器同时拒绝 `(0, 1]` 区间之外的数值。解析结果暴露为只读属性 `coverage_threshold`，对其赋值会抛出 `AttributeError`；若需为单个聚合器指定不同阈值，应在构造前通过全局参数管理器或注入的 `parameter_manager` 修改该参数并完成参数校验。该配置不接受 `cf_compliant` 字段，亦不构成完整数据集层面的气候与预报（Climate and Forecast, CF）合规认证。运行时的区间边界、日历、单位、时间语义与覆盖率均由时间变换算子执行检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:97
msgid "`TemporalConfig.from_resolved_settings(source_frequency=..., target_frequency=..., settings=..., direction=..., spatial_basis=..., device=...)` builds this configuration from one already resolved settings mapping. `settings` may contain only `conservation_level`, `conservation_level_overrides`, and `temporal_semantics`; any other key, such as `coverage_threshold`, raises `ValueError`. The displayed override mapping is created by a dataclass factory, not shared across instances."
msgstr "`TemporalConfig.from_resolved_settings(source_frequency=..., target_frequency=..., settings=..., direction=..., spatial_basis=..., device=...)` 从已解析的设置映射构造该配置。`settings` 只能包含 `conservation_level`、`conservation_level_overrides` 和 `temporal_semantics`；其他键（如 `coverage_threshold`）会抛出 `ValueError`。展示的覆盖映射由数据类工厂创建，实例之间不共享。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:104
msgid "`AggregationConfig`"
msgstr "`AggregationConfig`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:113
msgid "`method` selects the statistic: `MEAN`, `TIME_WEIGHTED_MEAN`, `SUM`, `MINIMUM`, `MAXIMUM`, `MEDIAN`, `VARIANCE`, `STANDARD_DEVIATION`, or `RANGE`. `PERCENTILE` exists in the enumeration but raises `ValueError`, because CF defines no general percentile cell-method token. `time_dim` selects the time axis of the data; a negative value counts from the last axis. The configuration has no other fields, and any other keyword raises `TypeError`. Interval labels and closure are not configurable: every interval is the explicit half-open bound pair `[start, end)` passed to `aggregate()`, and the target coordinate is the caller's `target_time`."
msgstr "`method` 选择统计量：`MEAN`、`TIME_WEIGHTED_MEAN`、`SUM`、`MINIMUM`、`MAXIMUM`、`MEDIAN`、`VARIANCE`、`STANDARD_DEVIATION` 或 `RANGE`。枚举中虽有 `PERCENTILE`，但使用时抛出 `ValueError`，因为 CF 没有通用的百分位单元方法标记。`time_dim` 选择数据时间轴，负值从最后一个轴倒数。配置没有其他字段，其他关键字抛出 `TypeError`。区间标签与开闭方式不可配置：每个区间均为传给 `aggregate()` 的显式半开边界对 `[start, end)`，目标坐标由调用方的 `target_time` 给出。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:123
msgid "`TemporalAggregator`"
msgstr "`TemporalAggregator`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:169
msgid "With `data = [280, 282, 290]` K on the source intervals `[0, 1)`, `[1, 2)`, and `[2, 4)` h and one target interval `[0, 4)` h, the result is the duration-weighted mean 285.5 K. Missing `temporal_semantics`, `target_units`, calendar, or `time_units` raise `ValueError`. Every method also needs both bounds, and the mean and sum methods need `measure_units`; a missing one raises `ValueError`. `state_at_boundary` returns before these checks and needs neither bounds nor `measure_units`. Empty source `units` raise the temporal `ValidationError` described below for the mean and sum methods, which build the unit contract, and `ValueError` for the descriptive statistics and `state_at_boundary`, whose source and target units must be identical. Bounds are never inferred. The calendar must be `noleap` or `360_day`; any other calendar, including `standard`, raises `ValueError`. Interval means and rates also need `integration_time_unit`, and an `interval_accumulation` must not declare one. The aggregator maps fixed intervals only: a `monthly`, `seasonal`, or `annual` source or target frequency raises `ValueError` in `aggregate()`, because calendar periods belong to the calendar owners. At every conservation level other than `none`, including the default `moderate`, `q_ref_parameter` must also name a ParameterManager key in `measure_units`."
msgstr "源区间 `[0, 1)`、`[1, 2)`、`[2, 4)` h 上的值为 `data = [280, 282, 290]` K，目标区间为 `[0, 4)` h 时，结果为时长加权均值 285.5 K。缺少 `temporal_semantics`、`target_units`、日历或 `time_units` 会抛出 `ValueError`。各方法还需要两组边界，均值和求和方法还需要 `measure_units`；缺失时抛出 `ValueError`。`state_at_boundary` 在这些检查前返回，不需要边界或 `measure_units`。源 `units` 为空时，构造单位契约的均值和求和方法抛出下文的时间 `ValidationError`；要求源与目标单位相同的描述统计及 `state_at_boundary` 则抛出 `ValueError`。绝不推断边界。日历必须为 `noleap` 或 `360_day`；其他日历（包括 `standard`）抛出 `ValueError`。区间均值和速率还需要 `integration_time_unit`，而 `interval_accumulation` 不得声明此项。聚合器仅映射固定区间：源或目标频率为 `monthly`、`seasonal` 或 `annual` 时，`aggregate()` 抛出 `ValueError`，因为日历周期由日历组件负责。除 `none` 外的所有守恒级别（包括默认 `moderate`）还要求 `q_ref_parameter` 指定一个单位为 `measure_units` 的 ParameterManager 键。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:188
msgid "`TemporalAggregator.forward` and `TemporalDisaggregator.forward` require a non-empty `variable_name` (the key of the returned update; a `standard_name` never stands in for it) and non-empty `units`. `aggregate`, `disaggregate`, and `upscale` require `units`; `variable_name`, `standard_name`, and `cell_methods` are optional there: absent means an unnamed field, no CF identity, and no earlier cell method, the absent names are omitted from the result metadata (never published as an empty string), and an empty string raises `ValueError`. The disaggregator no longer keys an unnamed output as `disaggregated`."
msgstr "`TemporalAggregator.forward` 和 `TemporalDisaggregator.forward` 要求非空 `variable_name`（返回更新的键；`standard_name` 不能代替它）及非空 `units`。`aggregate`、`disaggregate` 和 `upscale` 要求 `units`；其中 `variable_name`、`standard_name` 和 `cell_methods` 可选：缺失分别表示无名称场、无 CF 标识及无先前单元方法。缺失名称不写入结果元数据（绝不以空字符串发布），空字符串会抛出 `ValueError`。解聚器不再将无名称输出键设为 `disaggregated`。"

