#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:206
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The method defaults to `TIME_WEIGHTED_MEAN`; the mapping law is fixed by the explicit `temporal_semantics` together with the method, never by names, units, or roles. Let $O_{ij}$ be the overlap duration of source interval $I_i$ with target interval $J_j$, and $m_i=1$ for a finite source value and $m_i=0$ for NaN (Inf raises). Values keep their sign; overlap durations are non-negative."
msgstr "默认方法为 `TIME_WEIGHTED_MEAN`；映射律由显式 `temporal_semantics` 与所选方法共同决定，绝不按名称、单位或角色推断。设 $O_{ij}$ 为源区间 $I_i$ 与目标区间 $J_j$ 的重叠时长，源值有限时 $m_i=1$，为 NaN 时 $m_i=0$（Inf 会报错）。数值保留符号，重叠时长非负。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:212
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`MEAN` and `TIME_WEIGHTED_MEAN` run the same kernel. They accept `interval_mean` and `rate` and return the mean over the observed support, $y_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}x_i/\\sum_im_iO_{ij}$."
msgstr "`MEAN` 和 `TIME_WEIGHTED_MEAN` 使用同一计算核，接受 `interval_mean` 和 `rate`，返回观测支撑域上的均值 $y_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}x_i/\\sum_im_iO_{ij}$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:215
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SUM` integrates a `rate` into an interval accumulation, $Y_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}r_i$ with $O_{ij}$ in `integration_time_unit`, converted from `measure_units` to `target_units`; it partitions an `interval_accumulation` by duration, $Y_j=\\sum_im_i(O_{ij}/\\lvert I_i\\rvert)a_i$."
msgstr "`SUM` 将 `rate` 积分为区间累积量 $Y_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}r_i$，其中 $O_{ij}$ 以 `integration_time_unit` 表示，再从 `measure_units` 转换为 `target_units`；对 `interval_accumulation` 则按时长划分，得到 $Y_j=\\sum_im_i(O_{ij}/\\lvert I_i\\rvert)a_i$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:219
msgid "`MINIMUM`, `MAXIMUM`, `MEDIAN` (the lower duration-weighted median), `VARIANCE` (the duration-weighted population variance), `STANDARD_DEVIATION`, and `RANGE` require `interval_mean` and identical source and target units, and use the finite samples with positive overlap. `VARIANCE` also needs `variance_units`, the square of `target_units` on the same scale. `STANDARD_DEVIATION` and `RANGE` accept `units_metadata` only when it is absent or `temperature: difference`."
msgstr "`MINIMUM`、`MAXIMUM`、`MEDIAN`（时长加权的下中位数）、`VARIANCE`（时长加权总体方差）、`STANDARD_DEVIATION` 和 `RANGE` 要求 `interval_mean` 且源与目标单位相同，使用具有正重叠的有限样本。`VARIANCE` 还需要 `variance_units`，即同一尺度下 `target_units` 的平方。`STANDARD_DEVIATION` 和 `RANGE` 仅接受未提供或为 `temperature: difference` 的 `units_metadata`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:226
msgid "`state_at_boundary` maps exact boundary instants and does no arithmetic; source and target units must be identical."
msgstr "`state_at_boundary` 映射精确边界时刻，不作算术运算；源与目标单位必须相同。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:229
msgid "Coverage, residuals, and errors"
msgstr "覆盖率、残差与错误"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:231
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The valid coverage of target interval $J_j$ is $c_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}/\\lvert J_j\\rvert$ (dimensionless). Missing data are never scaled up. An output whose $c_j$ is below the coverage threshold $\\theta$ (`coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold`; current configuration: 0.8) is NaN and set in `insufficient_coverage_mask`. `MINIMUM`, `MAXIMUM`, and `RANGE` keep their value whenever $c_j>0$; the mask still records the insufficient coverage. An output at or above the threshold covers only the observed part: a rate of 1e-4 kg m-2 s-1 summed over ten hours with one hour missing gives 3.24 kg m-2 with $c_j=0.9$, not 3.6 kg m-2."
msgstr "目标区间 $J_j$ 的有效覆盖率为 $c_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}/\\lvert J_j\\rvert$（无量纲）。绝不放大缺测数据。$c_j$ 低于覆盖率阈值 $\\theta$（`coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold`；当前值 0.8）的输出为 NaN，并在 `insufficient_coverage_mask` 中标记。`MINIMUM`、`MAXIMUM` 和 `RANGE` 只要满足 $c_j>0$ 就保留结果，但掩码仍记录覆盖不足。达到或超过阈值的输出也只覆盖已观测部分：1e-4 kg m-2 s-1 的速率在十小时中缺失一小时时，求和结果为 3.24 kg m-2，$c_j=0.9$，而不是 3.6 kg m-2。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:241
msgid "The conservation level controls the mapping residual $R=\\sum_jq^{\\mathrm{tgt}}_j-\\sum_{i,j}q^{\\mathrm{src}}_{ij}$, where the contributions $q$ are measures in `measure_units` on the accepted targets; a positive $R$ means that the target measure exceeds the source measure. The relative residual is $\\lvert R\\rvert/\\max(a,q_{\\mathrm{ref}})$ (dimensionless), with the source activity $a=\\sum_{i,j}\\lvert q^{\\mathrm{src}}_{ij}\\rvert$ and $q_{\\mathrm{ref}}$ the positive parameter named by `q_ref_parameter`. `none` computes no residual; `relaxed` computes it without a tolerance comparison; `moderate` compares the largest relative residual with `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance` (the level selects no tolerance) and reports the outcome in `conservation_passed` and `conservation_violation`; `strict` raises `ValueError` on a violation. The residual is reported and never used to correct values. `state_at_boundary` and the descriptive statistics (`MINIMUM` to `RANGE`) have no residual law, so every level other than `none` raises `ValueError` for them."
msgstr "守恒级别控制映射残差 $R=\\sum_jq^{\\mathrm{tgt}}_j-\\sum_{i,j}q^{\\mathrm{src}}_{ij}$，其中贡献 $q$ 是已接受目标上、单位为 `measure_units` 的度量；$R$ 为正表示目标度量大于源度量。相对残差为 $\\lvert R\\rvert/\\max(a,q_{\\mathrm{ref}})$（无量纲），其中源活动量为 $a=\\sum_{i,j}\\lvert q^{\\mathrm{src}}_{ij}\\rvert$，$q_{\\mathrm{ref}}$ 为 `q_ref_parameter` 指定的正值参数。`none` 不计算残差；`relaxed` 计算但不与容差比较；`moderate` 将最大相对残差与 `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance` 比较（级别不选择容差），并在 `conservation_passed` 和 `conservation_violation` 中报告结果；`strict` 在违反条件时抛出 `ValueError`。残差仅作报告，绝不用于修正数值。`state_at_boundary` 和描述统计（`MINIMUM` 至 `RANGE`）没有残差定律，因此除 `none` 外的任何级别都会对它们抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:257
msgid "An accepted target has a finite value and a valid coverage at or above the threshold; an accumulation target must also be completely covered. A target that is not accepted is left out of the residual even when its value is finite. An output element (one series along the non-time axes) without any accepted target keeps its output and is excluded explicitly. That output is NaN when no target reached the threshold, but a `SUM` target at or above the threshold that is not completely covered keeps its finite partial accumulation. An excluded element's residual is NaN, it is not checked, and it is flagged in `mapping_excluded_output_mask` and counted in `mapping_excluded_output_count`, while `mapping_excluded_target_count` counts all rejected targets. When no element can be checked, the diagnostics report `conservation_checked=False`, `conservation_passed=None`, and `conservation_skip_reason=\"no_accepted_target_support\"`, and `strict` does not raise. The 3.24 kg m-2 example above is such a case: at `relaxed`, `moderate`, and `strict` it returns 3.24 kg m-2 with `mapping_excluded_output_count=1` and this skip reason, so the partial accumulation is never conservation-checked."
msgstr "已接受目标须为有限值，且有效覆盖率达到阈值；累积量目标还必须完全覆盖。即使数值有限，未接受目标也不计入残差。没有任何已接受目标的输出元素（非时间轴上的一个序列）保留输出，并被显式排除。没有目标达到阈值时该输出为 NaN；但达到阈值而未完全覆盖的 `SUM` 目标保留有限的部分累积量。被排除元素的残差为 NaN，不参与检查，在 `mapping_excluded_output_mask` 中标记，并计入 `mapping_excluded_output_count`；`mapping_excluded_target_count` 统计所有被拒绝的目标。无元素可检查时，诊断报告 `conservation_checked=False`、`conservation_passed=None` 和 `conservation_skip_reason=\"no_accepted_target_support\"`，`strict` 不会抛错。前述 3.24 kg m-2 即属于此情形：`relaxed`、`moderate` 和 `strict` 均返回 3.24 kg m-2，伴随 `mapping_excluded_output_count=1` 及此跳过原因，因此该部分累积量从未经过守恒检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:274
msgid "`aggregate()` does not wrap errors. Argument, metadata, and domain errors raise `ValueError`, and an argument of the wrong type raises `TypeError`. An invalid CF time-units string or unit contract raises the temporal core's `ValidationError`, exported by `relic.coupling.scales.temporal`. `RuntimeError` is raised only by internal consistency checks. In a governed Functor call, `FunctorBase` re-raises a `TypeError`, `ValueError`, `KeyError`, `AttributeError`, `RuntimeError`, `ImportError`, or `OSError` as `ExecutionError` with the original error as its cause. The temporal `ValidationError` derives directly from `Exception`, so it is not wrapped and reaches the caller unchanged."
msgstr "`aggregate()` 不包装错误。参数、元数据及定义域错误抛出 `ValueError`，参数类型错误抛出 `TypeError`。CF 时间单位字符串或单位契约无效时，抛出时间核心的 `ValidationError`，由 `relic.coupling.scales.temporal` 导出。`RuntimeError` 仅由内部一致性检查抛出。受治理 Functor 调用中，`FunctorBase` 将 `TypeError`、`ValueError`、`KeyError`、`AttributeError`、`RuntimeError`、`ImportError` 或 `OSError` 重新抛为 `ExecutionError`，并保留原错误作为原因。时间 `ValidationError` 直接继承 `Exception`，因此不被包装，原样到达调用方。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:285
msgid "`TemporalDisaggregator`"
msgstr "`TemporalDisaggregator`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:303
msgid "Fields left as `None` are read from `coupling.scales.temporal.disaggregation.allow_negative`, `.use_physical_constraints`, and `.time_dim` (current configuration: `false`, `true`, and `0`). Only `UNIFORM`, the piecewise-constant reconstruction, runs; `LINEAR`, the spline methods, the profile methods (`CLIMATOLOGY_DIURNAL`, `EXTERNAL_DRIVER`), and `STOCHASTIC` raise `ValueError`. With `use_physical_constraints` true and `allow_negative` false, a finite input below `coupling.scales.conservative.clamp_min` (current configuration: 0) raises without clamping. There are no profile, smoothing, external-weight, stochastic-noise, or tolerance fields; the mapping tolerance is `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance`."
msgstr "保留为 `None` 的字段从 `coupling.scales.temporal.disaggregation.allow_negative`、`.use_physical_constraints` 与 `.time_dim` 读取（当前配置值依次为 `false`、`true` 与 `0`）。当前仅分段常数重构方法 `UNIFORM` 可执行；`LINEAR`、各类样条方法、廓线方法（`CLIMATOLOGY_DIURNAL`、`EXTERNAL_DRIVER`）以及 `STOCHASTIC` 均直接抛出 `ValueError`。当 `use_physical_constraints` 为真且 `allow_negative` 为假时，低于 `coupling.scales.conservative.clamp_min`（当前配置值为 0）的有限输入会直接报错且不作截断。配置中不设廓线、平滑、外部权重、随机噪声或容差字段；映射守恒容差统一取自 `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:353
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`disaggregate()`, `downscale()`, and `forward()` take the bounds as `coarse_bounds` and `fine_bounds` or as `source_bounds` and `target_bounds` (`upscale()` as `fine_bounds` and `coarse_bounds` or the same two canonical names), one name per bound; passing both names for one bound raises `ValueError`, and error messages name the keys the caller used. `to_hourly()` and `to_daily()` require the keywords `coarse_time`, `fine_time`, `coarse_bounds`, and `fine_bounds`; `source_bounds` and `target_bounds` do not replace them there. With coarse interval $I_i$, fine interval $J_j$, and overlap $O_{ij}$, the fine values are $x_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}y_i/\\sum_im_iO_{ij}$ for interval means and rates and $x_j=\\sum_im_i(O_{ij}/\\lvert I_i\\rvert)a_i$ for an `interval_accumulation`. `DisaggregationResult` contains `data`, `metadata`, `conservation_error`, and `diagnostics` (reconstruction, bounds relation, geometric and valid coverage, gap fractions, observed measure, and the mapping-residual diagnostics)."
msgstr "`disaggregate()`、`downscale()` 和 `forward()` 接受 `coarse_bounds` 与 `fine_bounds`，或 `source_bounds` 与 `target_bounds` 作为边界名称（`upscale()` 接受 `fine_bounds` 与 `coarse_bounds`，或同样的两个规范名称）；每组边界只能用一个名称，同时给出两个名称会抛出 `ValueError`，错误消息会指出调用方使用的键。`to_hourly()` 和 `to_daily()` 必须提供关键字 `coarse_time`、`fine_time`、`coarse_bounds` 和 `fine_bounds`，此处 `source_bounds` 和 `target_bounds` 不能替代它们。粗区间 $I_i$、细区间 $J_j$ 的重叠为 $O_{ij}$ 时，区间均值和速率的细网格值为 $x_j=\\sum_im_iO_{ij}y_i/\\sum_im_iO_{ij}$，`interval_accumulation` 的细网格值为 $x_j=\\sum_im_i(O_{ij}/\\lvert I_i\\rvert)a_i$。`DisaggregationResult` 包含 `data`、`metadata`、`conservation_error` 和 `diagnostics`（重建方式、边界关系、几何及有效覆盖率、缺口比例、已观测度量和映射残差诊断）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:369
msgid "The disaggregator applies no coverage threshold. A fine interval without a finite coarse value is NaN for interval means and rates, but receives 0 for an `interval_accumulation`; its `diagnostics[\"valid_coverage\"]` is 0 in both cases, so check the coverage before using accumulated amounts. The conservation levels act as in aggregation, with the residual taken over the fine intervals that have a finite value and a positive valid coverage. Unlike aggregation, this includes partially covered accumulation intervals: when an `interval_accumulation` fine interval has a valid coverage between 0 and 1 (it extends past the coarse bounds or overlaps a coarse interval whose value is NaN), every level other than `none` raises the temporal `ValidationError`, because the accumulation residual requires complete coverage. With the level `none` the call returns the partial amount, for example 1 kg m-2 with valid coverage 0.5 for a fine interval [2, 4) h over a coarse interval [0, 3) h that holds 3 kg m-2. `conservation_error` is the largest relative residual over the checked series: NaN when a residual was computed but no series could be checked, and 0.0 when the level is `none`. Values are never corrected. The call needs the same explicit fields as aggregation, including a `noleap` or `360_day` calendar and, at a level other than `none`, `q_ref_parameter`; `state_at_boundary` also requires `state_boundary_policy` (`exact`, `left`, or `right`) and the conservation level `none`."
msgstr "降尺度解聚器不应用覆盖率阈值。缺少有限粗时间步数值的细时间区间，在区间均值与速率语义下输出 NaN，在 `interval_accumulation` 语义下输出 0；两种情形的 `diagnostics[\"valid_coverage\"]` 均为 0，使用累积量前应先核查有效覆盖率。各守恒级别的行为与时间聚合一致，残差在具有有限值且有效覆盖率为正的细时间区间上计算。与时间聚合不同，该范围涵盖部分覆盖的累积区间：当 `interval_accumulation` 细区间的有效覆盖率介于 0 和 1 之间（超出粗区间边界，或与取值为 NaN 的粗区间重叠）时，因累积量残差计算要求完全覆盖，除 `none` 以外的所有守恒级别均会抛出时间 `ValidationError`。当守恒级别设为 `none` 时，调用返回部分累积量；例如粗区间 [0, 3) h 总量为 3 kg m-2 时，细区间 [2, 4) h 返回 1 kg m-2 且有效覆盖率为 0.5。`conservation_error` 为受检序列上的最大相对残差：触发残差计算但无可检序列时为 NaN，守恒级别为 `none` 时为 0.0。解聚过程从不回修数值。调用时需传入与时间聚合一致的显式参数，包括 `noleap` 或 `360_day` 日历，以及非 `none` 守恒级别下的 `q_ref_parameter`；`state_at_boundary` 语义还须显式指定 `state_boundary_policy`（`exact`、`left` 或 `right`）并将守恒级别设为 `none`。"

