#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Require the conservative method for every field that is not categorical: a `cell_total`, `area_density`, or `intensive` field, or a field without a declared `spatial_basis`, raises `ValueError` with any other method. The conservative regridders the factory builds then raise `RuntimeError` in `regrid()` when the per-row covered-support ledger is rejected by `covered_support_acceptance` (the relative tolerance and floating-point rounding allowance). A variable's `require_conservation: true` metadata applies the same method rule to that variable. A field declared `categorical` is regridded only by `nearest` or `irregular_nearest`, with or without this flag; any other method raises `ValueError` for it. The weight check at construction does not depend on this flag."
msgstr "要求所有非分类场使用守恒方法：`cell_total`、`area_density`、`intensive` 场或未声明 `spatial_basis` 的场使用其他方法时，均抛出 `ValueError`。工厂创建的守恒重网格器若逐行覆盖支撑域收支未通过 `covered_support_acceptance`（相对容差及浮点舍入余量），将在 `regrid()` 中抛出 `RuntimeError`。变量元数据 `require_conservation: true` 对该变量应用相同方法规则。声明为 `categorical` 的场无论是否设置此标志，都只能使用 `nearest` 或 `irregular_nearest`；其他方法抛出 `ValueError`。构造时的权重检查不受此标志影响。"

