#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Weather Research and Forecasting model output (`wrfout_d*` files). Record times come from the `Times` variable parsed with `time_format`; missing or unparsable times raise, and files are ordered and concatenated along `Time` by these times only, which must increase strictly."
msgstr "Weather Research and Forecasting 模型输出（`wrfout_d*` 文件）。记录时间来自按 `time_format` 解析的 `Times` 变量；时间缺失或无法解析时会报错。文件仅按这些必须严格递增的时间排序，并沿 `Time` 拼接。"

