msgid "`CESMConfig`"
msgstr "`CESMConfig`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Community Earth System Model history output. `soil_layer_thickness` (m, one value per `H2OSOI` layer) is used only when the file has no `DZSOI`. `open()` adds no derived fields to the opened datasets (`CESMConfig` has no `compute_derived`; the former WSPD, Z and THETA had no reader)."
msgstr "Community Earth System Model 历史输出。`soil_layer_thickness`（m，每个 `H2OSOI` 层一个值）仅在文件没有 `DZSOI` 时使用。`open()` 不向已打开数据集添加派生字段（`CESMConfig` 没有 `compute_derived`；先前的 WSPD、Z 和 THETA 没有读取者）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`CMIP6Config`"
msgstr "`CMIP6Config`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "CMIP6 climate-model datasets."
msgstr "CMIP6气候模型数据集。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`VICConfig`"
msgstr "`VICConfig`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Variable Infiltration Capacity model output. Only `file_format=\"netcdf\"` is accepted; VIC ASCII and binary output raise `ValueError` when the configuration is built, because their columns carry no variable names. `record_interval` with `record_interval_units` declares the interval of water depths per record when the file has no CF time bounds; `time_step` is recorded as a dataset attribute only."
msgstr "Variable Infiltration Capacity 模型输出。仅接受 `file_format=\"netcdf\"`；VIC ASCII 和二进制输出的列不带变量名，因此构造配置时会抛出 `ValueError`。文件无 CF 时间边界时，`record_interval` 与 `record_interval_units` 共同声明逐记录水深对应的区间；`time_step` 仅记录为数据集属性。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "`SWATConfig`"
msgstr "`SWATConfig`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md
msgid "Soil and Water Assessment Tool output (`output.hru`, `output_level=\"hru\"`); print settings read from `file.cio` or declared as `nbyr`, `iyr`, `idaf`, `idal`, `iprint`, `nyskip`, and `icalen`, and the run's `calendar`. There is no `time_step` or `skip_warmup` field: the print frequency is IPRINT and the warm-up years are NYSKIP."
msgstr "Soil and Water Assessment Tool 输出（`output.hru`、`output_level=\"hru\"`）；输出设置从 `file.cio` 读取，或通过 `nbyr`、`iyr`、`idaf`、`idal`、`iprint`、`nyskip`、`icalen` 及运行 `calendar` 声明。没有 `time_step` 或 `skip_warmup` 字段：输出频率由 IPRINT 决定，预热年数为 NYSKIP。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:683
msgid "Every adapter configuration (`WRFConfig`, `CESMConfig`, `CMIP6Config`, `VICConfig`, and `SWATConfig`) has `time_interpolation` (`lower` or `linear`), the rule of a read at the simulation time; `None` (the default) is not a rule, and `forward` raises until it is declared. Each configuration also has `provided_variables`: the catalog variables the adapter writes (mapping targets of its source; `None` declares every mapping target). They are the adapter's declared outputs (it reads no state), `forward` returns exactly them (a provided variable the data lack raises; a request outside them raises), every update carries its catalog unit, and the adapter is their exclusive writer (`ConflictResolutionPolicy.EXCLUSIVE`): registering a second writer of any of them, an internal process such as Penman-Monteith or radiation or another adapter, raises. SWAT `forward` without an opened dataset of the configured output level raises an exception; silent empty-forcing return is not permitted."
msgstr "每个外部耦合适配器配置（`WRFConfig`、`CESMConfig`、`CMIP6Config`、`VICConfig` 与 `SWATConfig`）均包含 `time_interpolation`（取值为 `lower` 或 `linear`），用于指定模拟时刻的读取插值规则；默认值 `None` 不构成有效规则，未显式声明前调用 `forward` 会直接抛出异常。各配置同时包含 `provided_variables`，用于指定适配器负责写入的目录变量集合（即对应数据源的映射目标，`None` 表示声明该源的全部映射目标）。该集合即为适配器声明的输出变量（适配器不读取状态）；`forward` 严格返回这组变量（数据源缺失已声明变量或请求超出该集合时均抛出异常），每项更新均携带目录单位。适配器作为这些变量的独占写者（`ConflictResolutionPolicy.EXCLUSIVE`），若再注册任何内部过程（如 Penman-Monteith 蒸散发或辐射过程）或其他适配器写入同一变量，注册阶段即抛出异常。SWAT 适配器的 `forward` 在未打开对应配置输出级别的数据集时直接抛出异常，禁止静默返回空强迫字典。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:697
msgid "An adapter's declared expression is its read path, generated from the schema mapping and the declared source transforms (`ExternalAdapter.mapping_expression(source)`, one formula per transform kind in `TRANSFORM_EXPRESSIONS`). `FunctorMetadata` stores the canonical Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System (IPHS) form of that declaration (owner, no inputs, the provided variables as outputs); the read-path formula itself is returned by `mapping_expression`. WRF and CESM `open()` add no derived fields to the opened datasets; `WRFConfig` has no `extract_diagnostics` and `CESMConfig` no `compute_derived`."
msgstr "适配器的声明表达式即为其数据读取路径，由模式映射与已声明的数据源变换自动生成（对应 `ExternalAdapter.mapping_expression(source)`，`TRANSFORM_EXPRESSIONS` 中的每类变换各对应一条公式）。`FunctorMetadata` 存储该声明的规范互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）形式（标明归属方、无输入端口、以供给变量集作为输出端口），读取路径公式本身由 `mapping_expression` 返回。WRF 与 CESM 的 `open()` 不会向已打开的数据集注入任何派生字段；`WRFConfig` 不设 `extract_diagnostics` 字段，`CESMConfig` 亦不设 `compute_derived` 字段。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:706
msgid "Adapter availability means that the Python implementation can be imported. It does not establish that a source file, credentials, variable mapping, unit conversion, or target grid is ready. Always call `discover()` before `open()` and validate transformed data before simulation registration."
msgstr "适配器可用只表示其 Python 实现可以导入，并不表示源文件、凭证、变量映射、单位转换或目标网格已经就绪。请始终先调用 `discover()` 再调用 `open()`，并在注册到模拟之前验证转换后的数据。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:711
msgid "The `ExternalAdapter` base class is a template: its `forward()` raises `NotImplementedError`. The configured WRF, CESM, CMIP6, VIC, and SWAT adapters read existing model-output datasets through this lifecycle. They are not live two-way couplings with a running external model and do not certify compliance with an external coupling standard."
msgstr "`ExternalAdapter` 基类是一个模板：其 `forward()` 会引发 `NotImplementedError`。已配置的 WRF、CESM、CMIP6、VIC 和 SWAT 适配器通过这一生命周期读取现有的模型输出数据集。它们不是与正在运行的外部模型之间的实时双向耦合，也不认证对任何外部耦合标准的合规性。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:717
msgid "Read path"
msgstr "读取路径"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:719
msgid "Variables are mapped by meaning through the `InternalSchema` tables. Every mapped name is the canonical name of a ContractRegistry variable contract (never a contract alias, which StateManager refuses to write): WRF `PSFC`, CESM `PS`, and CMIP6 `ps` map to `atmospheric_pressure`. Each contract lists the adapter Functor of every source that maps to it (`WRFAdapter`, `CESMAdapter`, `CMIP6Adapter`, `VICAdapter`, `SWATAdapter`) under `writers.tendencies` and `provenance.adapter_writers`, in the contract units, which equal the catalog units. Variables no RELIC process writes are contracts of kind `forcing` (`convective_precipitation_flux`, `large_scale_precipitation_flux`, `eastward_wind`, `northward_wind`, `specific_humidity`, `surface_snow_amount`, and `mass_content_of_water_in_soil_layer` among them). One CF identity is held by one variable: surface downwelling shortwave and longwave radiation (WRF `SWDOWN`, `LWDOWN` and `GLW`; CESM `FSDS` and `FLDS`; CMIP6 `rsds` and `rlds`) map to `shortwave_down` and `longwave_down` (CF `surface_downwelling_shortwave_flux_in_air` and `surface_downwelling_longwave_flux_in_air`), the latent heat flux (WRF `LH`, CESM `EFLX_LH_TOT`, CMIP6 `hfls`) to `latent_heat_flux` (CF `surface_upward_latent_heat_flux`, signed, catalog valid range -245 to 1470 W m-2), and VIC `OUT_EVAP` and SWAT `ET` to `evapotranspiration_flux` (CF `water_evapotranspiration_flux`); the external catalog holds these entries under the contract names. `eastward_wind` and `northward_wind` are the near-surface wind at 10 m (WRF `U10` and `V10`, CMIP6 `uas` and `vas`); `wind_u` and `wind_v` are the wind components of the tracer-transport grid read by `AtmosphericAdvectionDiffusionFunctor`, a different vertical support, and hold no CF name. Daily extrema map to `air_temperature_max` and `air_temperature_min` (`air_temperature` with `cell_methods` `time: maximum` and `time: minimum`; CMIP6 `tasmax` and `tasmin`, VIC `TMAX` and `TMIN`), never to `air_temperature`. Convective and large-scale precipitation keep their own names (CMIP6 `prc` and WRF `RAINC` map to `convective_precipitation_flux`, WRF `RAINNC` and CESM `PRECL` to `large_scale_precipitation_flux`; all of them are liquid plus solid), so `precipitation_flux` comes only from a total such as CMIP6 `pr` or CESM `PRECT`. CMIP6 `prsn` (solid phase) maps to `snowfall`. CAM writes the snow rates `PRECSL` and `PRECSC` and no `PRECS`; surface rain (`PRECT - PRECSC - PRECSL`) and snowfall (`PRECSC + PRECSL`) combine several fields, so no CESM field maps to `rain_flux` or `snowfall`. Water fluxes such as VIC `OUT_EVAP` and SWAT `ET` map to `evapotranspiration_flux` (CF `water_evapotranspiration_flux`), not to the latent heat flux. The CESM lowest-model-level fields `TBOT`, `PBOT`, `QBOT`, `UBOT`, and `VBOT` are not mapped; CESM `PS` maps to `atmospheric_pressure` and `U10` to `wind_speed`, and `QREFHT` is not mapped. When several external fields map to one internal name, `read()` uses the declared canonical source: WRF `GLW` for `longwave_down` and CESM `TREFHT` for `air_temperature` (`TSA` is the land-only value). Without a declared canonical source the request raises `ValueError`, and an internal name that the source does not map raises `KeyError`; for example, `air_temperature` cannot be read from VIC. `InternalSchema.create_mapping(source, variables)` and `ExternalAdapter.get_variable_mapping(variables)` return the mapping of every requested variable or raise `KeyError` naming every variable the source does not provide."
msgstr "变量通过 `InternalSchema` 表按含义映射。每个映射名称都是 ContractRegistry 变量契约的规范名（绝不是 StateManager 拒绝写入的契约别名）：WRF `PSFC`、CESM `PS` 和 CMIP6 `ps` 映射为 `atmospheric_pressure`。每个契约在 `writers.tendencies` 和 `provenance.adapter_writers` 下列出映射到它的各来源适配器 Functor（`WRFAdapter`、`CESMAdapter`、`CMIP6Adapter`、`VICAdapter`、`SWATAdapter`），采用与目录单位一致的契约单位。没有 RELIC 过程写入的变量采用 `forcing` 类型契约，其中包括 `convective_precipitation_flux`、`large_scale_precipitation_flux`、`eastward_wind`、`northward_wind`、`specific_humidity`、`surface_snow_amount` 和 `mass_content_of_water_in_soil_layer`。一个 CF 标识只由一个变量持有：地表向下短波和长波辐射（WRF `SWDOWN`、`LWDOWN`、`GLW`；CESM `FSDS`、`FLDS`；CMIP6 `rsds`、`rlds`）映射为 `shortwave_down` 和 `longwave_down`（CF `surface_downwelling_shortwave_flux_in_air` 和 `surface_downwelling_longwave_flux_in_air`）；潜热通量（WRF `LH`、CESM `EFLX_LH_TOT`、CMIP6 `hfls`）映射为 `latent_heat_flux`（CF `surface_upward_latent_heat_flux`，有符号，目录有效范围 -245 至 1470 W m-2）；VIC `OUT_EVAP` 和 SWAT `ET` 映射为 `evapotranspiration_flux`（CF `water_evapotranspiration_flux`）。外部目录以契约名保存这些条目。`eastward_wind` 和 `northward_wind` 是 10 m 高度的近地表风（WRF `U10`、`V10`，CMIP6 `uas`、`vas`）；`wind_u` 和 `wind_v` 是 `AtmosphericAdvectionDiffusionFunctor` 读取的示踪物输运网格风分量，垂直支撑域不同，且不带 CF 名称。日极值映射为 `air_temperature_max` 和 `air_temperature_min`（`air_temperature` 配以 `cell_methods` `time: maximum` 和 `time: minimum`；CMIP6 `tasmax`、`tasmin`，VIC `TMAX`、`TMIN`），绝不映射为 `air_temperature`。对流降水和大尺度降水保留各自名称（CMIP6 `prc` 与 WRF `RAINC` 映射为 `convective_precipitation_flux`，WRF `RAINNC` 与 CESM `PRECL` 映射为 `large_scale_precipitation_flux`；均包括液态和固态），因此 `precipitation_flux` 只来自 CMIP6 `pr` 或 CESM `PRECT` 等总量。CMIP6 `prsn`（固态）映射为 `snowfall`。CAM 写出降雪速率 `PRECSL` 和 `PRECSC`，不写 `PRECS`；地表降雨（`PRECT - PRECSC - PRECSL`）与降雪（`PRECSC + PRECSL`）需要组合多个字段，因此没有 CESM 字段映射为 `rain_flux` 或 `snowfall`。VIC `OUT_EVAP` 和 SWAT `ET` 等水通量映射为 `evapotranspiration_flux`（CF `water_evapotranspiration_flux`），而不是潜热通量。CESM 最低模型层字段 `TBOT`、`PBOT`、`QBOT`、`UBOT` 和 `VBOT` 不参与映射；CESM `PS` 映射为 `atmospheric_pressure`，`U10` 映射为 `wind_speed`，`QREFHT` 不参与映射。多个外部字段映射到同一内部名时，`read()` 使用声明的规范来源：`longwave_down` 取 WRF `GLW`，`air_temperature` 取 CESM `TREFHT`（`TSA` 是仅陆地的值）。未声明规范来源时请求抛出 `ValueError`，来源无法映射的内部名抛出 `KeyError`；例如无法从 VIC 读取 `air_temperature`。`InternalSchema.create_mapping(source, variables)` 和 `ExternalAdapter.get_variable_mapping(variables)` 返回每个请求变量的映射，或抛出 `KeyError` 并列出来源不提供的所有变量。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:772
msgid "The units a file declares are authoritative. The VIC and SWAT adapters fill units from their own tables only for variables whose file declares none. In these two adapters a data variable records `units_source`: `file` when the file declares its units and `adapter_table` when the table supplied them; a variable without units in the file or the table gets no `units_source`. After the source transform, the unit conversion to the catalog units of `coupling.external.variables.variable_definitions` runs; a variable missing from the catalog raises `KeyError`, a field without a units attribute raises `ValueError`, and an unsupported conversion raises."
msgstr "文件声明的单位具有权威性。VIC 和 SWAT 适配器仅在文件未声明变量单位时才从各自表格补充。两者在数据变量中记录 `units_source`：文件声明单位时为 `file`，由表格提供时为 `adapter_table`；文件和表格均无单位的变量不设置 `units_source`。源转换后，执行到 `coupling.external.variables.variable_definitions` 目录单位的转换；变量不在目录中时抛出 `KeyError`，字段没有单位属性时抛出 `ValueError`，不支持的转换也会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:782
msgid "Declared source transforms (`InternalSchema.source_transforms()`) run before the unit conversion. $\\rho_w$ is the water density (physical constant `water_density`, kg m-3):"
msgstr "声明的源转换（`InternalSchema.source_transforms()`）在单位转换前执行。$\\rho_w$ 为水密度（物理常数 `water_density`，kg m-3）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:786
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Accumulations: WRF `RAINNC` and `RAINC` (with the bucket counters `I_RAINNC` and `I_RAINC` and the file attribute `BUCKET_MM`) and `PRCP_ACC` (no bucket) accumulate since the simulation start. With the accumulated depth $P_k$ (mm), the bucket counter $I_k$, and the bucket size $B$ (mm), the total is $A_k=P_k+I_kB$ and the rate is $r_k=\\rho_w(A_k-A_{k-1})/(t_k-t_{k-1})$ in kg m-2 s-1, with the depth difference converted from mm to m and $t$ in s. The rate belongs to $(t_{k-1},t_k]$ and is stored at $t_k$; the first record is consumed as the initial accumulation, so the result has one record fewer. The file must declare the accumulation in mm. A decreasing accumulation raises unless the bucket counter is present and applied, and a counter without a positive `BUCKET_MM` raises. Hourly accumulations of 0, 2, and 5 mm give 2/3600 and 3/3600 kg m-2 s-1."
msgstr "累积量：WRF `RAINNC` 和 `RAINC`（配合桶计数器 `I_RAINNC`、`I_RAINC` 及文件属性 `BUCKET_MM`）和 `PRCP_ACC`（无桶）均从模拟开始累计。累计深度 $P_k$（mm）、桶计数 $I_k$ 和桶容量 $B$（mm）给出总量 $A_k=P_k+I_kB$，速率为 $r_k=\\rho_w(A_k-A_{k-1})/(t_k-t_{k-1})$，单位 kg m-2 s-1，其中深度差从 mm 转为 m，$t$ 以秒计。速率属于 $(t_{k-1},t_k]$，存储在 $t_k$；首条记录作为初始累积量消耗，因此结果少一条记录。文件必须将累积量单位声明为 mm。累积量减小时，除非已提供并应用桶计数器，否则报错；计数器缺少正值 `BUCKET_MM` 也会报错。逐小时累积 0、2、5 mm 分别给出 2/3600 和 3/3600 kg m-2 s-1。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:798
msgid "Layered soil water: WRF `SMOIS` and CESM `H2OSOI` are volumetric contents $\\theta_k$ (m3 m-3) per layer and become $m_k=\\rho_w\\theta_k\\Delta z_k$ (kg m-2, `mass_content_of_water_in_soil_layer`). The thickness $\\Delta z_k$ (m) comes from the output (`DZS` in wrfout; `DZSOI` in CLM history, whose top layers are the `levsoi` layers) or, for CESM output without `DZSOI`, from `CESMConfig.soil_layer_thickness` (one value per layer); without either the read raises. $\\theta=0.3$ and $\\Delta z=0.1$ m give 30 kg m-2."
msgstr "分层土壤水：WRF `SMOIS` 和 CESM `H2OSOI` 为各层体积含量 $\\theta_k$（m3 m-3），转换为 $m_k=\\rho_w\\theta_k\\Delta z_k$（kg m-2，`mass_content_of_water_in_soil_layer`）。厚度 $\\Delta z_k$（m）来自输出（wrfout 的 `DZS`；CLM 历史的 `DZSOI`，其中顶部层为 `levsoi` 层），CESM 输出没有 `DZSOI` 时则来自 `CESMConfig.soil_layer_thickness`（每层一个值）；两者均无时读取报错。$\\theta=0.3$ 且 $\\Delta z=0.1$ m 时结果为 30 kg m-2。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:805
msgid "Water depths: VIC `OUT_SOIL_MOIST` (per `nlayer` layer) and `OUT_SWE` are liquid-equivalent depths $d$ and become $m=\\rho_wd$ (kg m-2). VIC `OUT_SWE` includes snow intercepted by the canopy, whereas the CF name it maps to, `surface_snow_amount`, means snow on the ground; the adapter does not separate the two."
msgstr "水深：VIC `OUT_SOIL_MOIST`（各 `nlayer` 层）和 `OUT_SWE` 是液态当量深度 $d$，转换为 $m=\\rho_wd$（kg m-2）。VIC `OUT_SWE` 包含冠层截留雪，而其映射的 CF 名称 `surface_snow_amount` 表示地面积雪；适配器不区分两者。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:810
msgid "Water depth fluxes: VIC `PRCP`, `OUT_EVAP`, `OUT_RUNOFF`, and `OUT_BASEFLOW`, and SWAT `PRECIP`, `SURQ_GEN`, `LATQGEN`, and `ET`. A field in length per time units becomes $F=\\rho_wv$; a water depth $d_k$ per record becomes $F_k=\\rho_wd_k/(t^{\\mathrm{end}}_k-t^{\\mathrm{start}}_k)$ in kg m-2 s-1. The record interval comes from the CF time bounds of the file's `time` coordinate (its `bounds` attribute) or, only when the file declares no bounds, from `record_interval` with `record_interval_units` in `VICConfig` or `SWATConfig` (declared together, for example `1.0` and `\"day\"`). The interval is never inferred from the coordinate spacing; without either declaration the read raises. SWAT `output.hru` records always carry their bounds, and a configured `record_interval` then raises."
msgstr "水深通量：VIC `PRCP`、`OUT_EVAP`、`OUT_RUNOFF`、`OUT_BASEFLOW` 及 SWAT `PRECIP`、`SURQ_GEN`、`LATQGEN`、`ET`。单位为长度除以时间的场转换为 $F=\\rho_wv$；逐记录水深 $d_k$ 转换为 $F_k=\\rho_wd_k/(t^{\\mathrm{end}}_k-t^{\\mathrm{start}}_k)$，单位 kg m-2 s-1。记录区间来自文件 `time` 坐标的 CF 时间边界（其 `bounds` 属性）；仅在文件未声明边界时，才采用 `VICConfig` 或 `SWATConfig` 中的 `record_interval` 与 `record_interval_units`（必须同时声明，例如 `1.0` 和 `\"day\"`）。绝不从坐标间距推断区间；两种声明均缺失时读取报错。SWAT `output.hru` 记录始终携带边界，此时另行配置 `record_interval` 会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:821
msgid "Water vapour mixing ratio: WRF `Q2` is the 2 m mixing ratio $w$ (WRF Registry `QV at 2 M`, kg kg-1); the specific humidity is $q=w/(1+w)$ (transform `mixing_ratio`; the file must declare `kg kg-1`)."
msgstr "水汽混合比：WRF `Q2` 是 2 m 高度的混合比 $w$（WRF Registry `QV at 2 M`，kg kg-1）；比湿为 $q=w/(1+w)$（转换 `mixing_ratio`；文件必须声明 `kg kg-1`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:824
msgid "Grid-relative wind: WRF `U10` and `V10` are grid-relative; `eastward_wind` and `northward_wind` are $u_e=u\\cos a-v\\sin a$ and $v_e=v\\cos a+u\\sin a$ with the file's `COSALPHA` and `SINALPHA` (transform `earth_relative_wind`; missing fields raise)."
msgstr "网格相对风：WRF `U10` 和 `V10` 相对于网格；利用文件中的 `COSALPHA` 和 `SINALPHA`，`eastward_wind` 和 `northward_wind` 分别为 $u_e=u\\cos a-v\\sin a$ 与 $v_e=v\\cos a+u\\sin a$（转换 `earth_relative_wind`；缺少字段会报错）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:829
msgid "Transform and quality control"
msgstr "转换与质量控制"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:831
msgid "`transform_to_internal()` regrids a field only when `target_grid` is given. The basis and the positivity come from `variable_metadata[name]`, which must declare `spatial_basis` and `valid_min`, or from the external variable catalog; an undeclared variable raises `KeyError`. `cell_total` and `area_density` fields use conservative remapping, `intensive` fields bilinear interpolation, and `categorical` fields nearest neighbour. The source grid is built from the field's CF latitude and longitude coordinates. The regridding step identifies them by their units (`degrees_north`, `degrees_east`) with a consistent `standard_name` and `axis`, never by coordinate names; a field without them raises. The adapters' `open()` differs: WRF sets `standard_name` and `units` on `XLAT` and `XLONG`, and CESM on `lat` and `lon`, by coordinate name and overwrites the values in the file, so for these two sources the identification rests on those names; VIC adds the attributes to `lat` and `lon` only where the file declares none. Conservative remapping needs the cell bounds that the file declares through the coordinates' `bounds` attribute (for example `lat_bnds` and `lon_bnds`); bounds are not inferred from the coordinate spacing. 1-D coordinates give a `regular` source grid with `coord_system` `latlon`, so the conservative weights and cell areas are spherical, in m2 (see \"Spatial regridding\" above), and a target grid in another coordinate system raises `ValueError`. Curvilinear (2-D) coordinates carry no bounds, so WRF area densities, such as radiation and precipitation fluxes, cannot be regridded conservatively: wrfout has no cell corners, and the call raises. The ingestion regridding runs through NumPy and xarray, so no gradient flows through it."
msgstr "`transform_to_internal()` 仅在提供 `target_grid` 时重网格。表示基准和正值约束来自必须声明 `spatial_basis`、`valid_min` 的 `variable_metadata[name]`，或来自外部变量目录；变量未声明时抛出 `KeyError`。`cell_total` 和 `area_density` 场采用守恒重映射，`intensive` 场采用双线性插值，`categorical` 场采用最近邻。源网格由场的 CF 经纬度坐标构建。重网格步骤依据坐标单位（`degrees_north`、`degrees_east`）及一致的 `standard_name` 和 `axis` 识别坐标，不依坐标名；缺少这些坐标时会报错。适配器的 `open()` 有所不同：WRF 按坐标名为 `XLAT` 和 `XLONG` 设置 `standard_name`、`units`，CESM 为 `lat`、`lon` 设置，并覆盖文件中的值，因此这两个来源的坐标识别依赖这些名称；VIC 仅在文件未声明时为 `lat`、`lon` 添加属性。守恒重映射需要文件通过坐标 `bounds` 属性声明的单元边界（例如 `lat_bnds`、`lon_bnds`），不从坐标间距推断边界。一维坐标给出 `regular` 源网格，其 `coord_system` 为 `latlon`，因此守恒权重和单元面积采用球面几何、单位 m2（见上文“空间重网格”）；目标网格使用不同坐标系统时抛出 `ValueError`。曲线二维坐标不携带边界，因此 WRF 的辐射和降水通量等面积密度无法进行守恒重网格：wrfout 没有单元角点，调用会报错。数据导入重网格通过 NumPy 和 xarray 运行，梯度不会穿过此路径。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:855
msgid "The catalog quality control marks values outside the catalog `valid_min` and `valid_max` as missing (NaN) and never fills missing values. The missing fraction is recorded under `quality_control` in the tensor's read metadata, and a field whose missing fraction exceeds `coupling.external.regrid.missing_threshold` (current configuration: 0.5) raises `ValueError`. The result is float32; the tensor passed in is not modified, and its gradient flag is left as the caller set it. `RegridOperator` itself applies no missing-data threshold: it reports the NaN fraction of the field it receives as `RegridResult.missing_data_fraction`."
msgstr "目录质量控制将超出目录 `valid_min` 和 `valid_max` 的数值标为缺失（NaN），绝不填补缺测值。缺测比例记录在张量读取元数据的 `quality_control` 中；超过 `coupling.external.regrid.missing_threshold`（当前值 0.5）时，该场抛出 `ValueError`。结果为 float32；不修改传入张量，其梯度标志保持调用方设定。`RegridOperator` 本身不应用缺测阈值，而是将收到字段的 NaN 比例报告为 `RegridResult.missing_data_fraction`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:865
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every external catalog entry declares `standard_name`, `long_name`, `units`, and `category` (one of the `VariableCategory` names); a missing field or an unknown category raises when the catalog is loaded; no entry is skipped and no category is assumed. The valid range of `evapotranspiration_flux` is declared once, with its references, in the external catalog entry ([-1.0e-4, 6.0e-4] kg m-2 s-1, signed: condensation and dew are negative); `coupling.scales.*.variables` repeat it, and `latent_heat_flux` has $\\lambda$ times that range ([-245, 1470] W m-2, $\\lambda=2.45\\times10^{6}$ J kg-1). The upper bound is the energy limit (1470 W m-2 of latent heat, about 1.08 times the total solar irradiance); the weighing-lysimeter alfalfa ET of Tolk, Evett and Howell (2006, Agron. J. 98(6):1646-1654), 11.3 mm d-1 on average over 13 advective days and above 15 mm d-1 on 3 days, is its observational support. `coupling.variables.<name>.bounds` holds exactly the bounds of the seven outputs registered by `register_coupling_variables` (boundary-layer conductance, root uptake profile, effective transpiration and the four soil-vegetation diagnostics), its only reader. The contracts of both variables declare no clipping bounds."
msgstr "每个外部目录条目均声明 `standard_name`、`long_name`、`units` 和 `category`（`VariableCategory` 名称之一）；字段缺失或类别未知时，加载目录会报错，不跳过条目，也不假定类别。`evapotranspiration_flux` 的有效范围仅在外部目录条目中连同参考文献声明一次（[-1.0e-4, 6.0e-4] kg m-2 s-1，有符号，凝结和露水为负）；`coupling.scales.*.variables` 重复该范围，`latent_heat_flux` 的范围为该范围乘以 $\\lambda$（[-245, 1470] W m-2，$\\lambda=2.45\\times10^{6}$ J kg-1）。上界为能量限制（潜热 1470 W m-2，约为太阳总辐照度的 1.08 倍）；观测依据为 Tolk、Evett 和 Howell（2006，Agron. J. 98(6):1646-1654）的称重式蒸渗仪苜蓿 ET：13 个平流日平均 11.3 mm d-1，其中 3 天超过 15 mm d-1。`coupling.variables.<name>.bounds` 精确保存其唯一读取者 `register_coupling_variables` 注册的七项输出边界（边界层导度、根系吸水剖面、有效蒸腾及四项土壤-植被诊断）。上述两个变量的契约均不声明裁剪边界。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:883
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Each of the following variables has one valid range, declared with its references in the external catalog entry when the variable is listed there and otherwise in `coupling.scales.defaults.variables` (the daily catalog repeats it); every other catalog repeats it: `precipitation_flux` and `runoff_flux` [0, 0.52] kg m-2 s-1 (0.52 = 31.2 mm in 1 min, the World Meteorological Organization (WMO) greatest 1-min rainfall; the runoff bound is a convention equal to it); `net_radiation` [-400, 2200] W m-2 (upper bound: $R_n\\le S_{down}$ and the greatest measured surface global irradiance 2177 W m-2, Cordero et al. 2023; lower bound a convention); `shortwave_down` [0, 2200] W m-2 (the same observed extreme rounded up); `longwave_down` [0, 700] W m-2 (derived: $L_{down}=\\varepsilon_a\\sigma T_a^4\\le\\sigma T_{max}^4$ = 671 W m-2 with emissivity at most 1 and the WMO greatest air temperature 56.7 degC); `sensible_heat_flux` [-200, 1000] W m-2 (convention); `stomatal_conductance` [0, 2.0] mol m-2 s-1 (convention above the woody-angiosperm maxima of Murray et al. 2019; the leaf-level conductance to water vapour in the unit of its readers `ozone_stress` and `oxygen_18`); `canopy_conductance` [0, 0.05] m s-1 (convention, 1.5 times the mean maximum crop surface conductance of Kelliher et al. 1995); `net_primary_productivity` [-1.0e-6, 1.0e-6] kg C m-2 s-1 (signed, NPP = GPP - R_a; convention above the peak hourly GPP of irrigated maize, Suyker et al. 2005); `soil_moisture` [0, 1] m3 m-3 (a volume fraction). `heterotrophic_respiration` is a non-negative release (its writers raise on a negative rate and it accumulates into the `carbon.total` boundary ledger); its contract declares `lower_bound` 0 and the sign convention `non_negative_release_to_atmosphere` (upward positive, as CF `surface_upward_mass_flux_of_carbon_dioxide_expressed_as_carbon_due_to_heterotrophic_respiration`), and it has no catalog range."
msgstr "下列各变量均具有唯一有效范围：若外部耦合目录收录了该变量，则连同文献依据在外部目录条目中声明，未收录者则在 `coupling.scales.defaults.variables` 中声明（日尺度目录及其他所有目录均复用同一范围）：`precipitation_flux` 与 `runoff_flux` 为 [0, 0.52] kg m-2 s-1（0.52 对应 1 min 降水量 31.2 mm，即世界气象组织（World Meteorological Organization, WMO）最大 1 min 降雨记录；径流上界按约定取同一数值）；`net_radiation` 为 [-400, 2200] W m-2（上界依据 $R_n\\le S_{down}$ 及地表总辐照度实测极值 2177 W m-2，Cordero 等，2023；下界为工程约定）；`shortwave_down` 为 [0, 2200] W m-2（取同一观测极值向上圆整）；`longwave_down` 为 [0, 700] W m-2（推导上界：取发射率上限 1 及 WMO 最高气温记录 56.7 degC 时，$L_{down}=\\varepsilon_a\\sigma T_a^4\\le\\sigma T_{max}^4$ = 671 W m-2）；`sensible_heat_flux` 为 [-200, 1000] W m-2（工程约定）；`stomatal_conductance` 为 [0, 2.0] mol m-2 s-1（工程约定，高于 Murray 等（2019）报道的木本被子植物最大值，表示叶片水汽导度，单位与其下游读取过程 `ozone_stress` 和 `oxygen_18` 一致）；`canopy_conductance` 为 [0, 0.05] m s-1（工程约定，取 Kelliher 等（1995）农作物冠层平均最大导度的 1.5 倍）；`net_primary_productivity` 为 [-1.0e-6, 1.0e-6] kg C m-2 s-1（有符号量，NPP = GPP - R_a，约定幅值高于 Suyker 等（2005）灌溉玉米小时尺度峰值 GPP）；`soil_moisture` 为 [0, 1] m3 m-3（体积含水率）。`heterotrophic_respiration` 为非负碳释放通量（写入负速率时直接报错，并累加记入 `carbon.total` 边界账本）；其契约声明 `lower_bound` 为 0，符号约定为 `non_negative_release_to_atmosphere`（向上为正，与 CF 标准名 `surface_upward_mass_flux_of_carbon_dioxide_expressed_as_carbon_due_to_heterotrophic_respiration` 一致），不另设目录数值上界。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:911
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The external data validator derives the statistics of its outlier check from the data; it keeps no per-variable reference statistics. Every threshold of the validator is a declared parameter; an unset `ValidationConfig` field takes it and an explicit value is kept: the outlier z-score 4.0, the flagged fractions 0.05 (WARNING) and 0.1 (ERROR), the largest time gap 48 h, the oldest accepted CF version 1.6, the global-coverage spans 350 and 170 deg and the check switches under `coupling.external.validation`; a missing-data fraction above `coupling.external.io.missing_data_warning_threshold` (0.1) is a WARNING and above `coupling.external.regrid.missing_threshold` (0.5) an ERROR. The outlier check assumes no minimum sample size: $n$ values cannot give a z-score above $\\sqrt{n-1}$ (Shiffler 1988)."
msgstr "外部数据验证器从数据本身计算异常值检查所需统计量，不保存逐变量参考统计值。验证器的每个阈值都来自声明参数；未设置的 `ValidationConfig` 字段读取参数，显式值予以保留：异常值 z-score 为 4.0，标记比例为 0.05（WARNING）和 0.1（ERROR），最大时间缺口 48 h，最低可接受 CF 版本 1.6，全球覆盖跨度为 350 和 170 度，检查开关位于 `coupling.external.validation`；缺测比例超过 `coupling.external.io.missing_data_warning_threshold`（0.1）为 WARNING，超过 `coupling.external.regrid.missing_threshold`（0.5）为 ERROR。异常值检查不假定最小样本量：$n$ 个数值的 z-score 不可能超过 $\\sqrt{n-1}$（Shiffler，1988）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:923
msgid "SWAT `output.hru`"
msgstr "SWAT `output.hru`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:925
msgid "Only the SWAT 2012 `output.hru` text table is implemented; use `SWATConfig(root_path=..., output_level=\"hru\", ...)`. `output_level` is required, and any other value, such as `\"sub\"`, `\"rch\"`, or `\"rsv\"`, raises `ValueError` when the configuration is built, because the row layouts of `output.sub`, `output.rch`, and `output.rsv` are not implemented. `SWATAdapter` requires a `SWATConfig`. `output.std`, `output.wtr`, and SWAT SQLite outputs are not read, and `SWATConfig` has no `output_format` or `database_path` field. The text reader follows the SWAT 2012 source:"
msgstr "仅实现 SWAT 2012 的 `output.hru` 文本表；应使用 `SWATConfig(root_path=..., output_level=\"hru\", ...)`。`output_level` 为必填项；配置构造时，`\"sub\"`、`\"rch\"` 或 `\"rsv\"` 等其他取值会抛出 `ValueError`，因为尚未实现 `output.sub`、`output.rch` 和 `output.rsv` 的行格式。`SWATAdapter` 要求 `SWATConfig`。不读取 `output.std`、`output.wtr` 或 SWAT SQLite 输出；`SWATConfig` 没有 `output_format` 或 `database_path` 字段。文本读取器遵循 SWAT 2012 源码："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:934
msgid "Header (headout.f90, format 1020): `LULC  HRU       GIS  SUB  MGT  MON   AREAkm2`, then one 10-character field per variable, the SWAT name followed by its unit suffix, for example `PRECIPmm`, `SOL_TMPdgC`, or `SOLARMJ/m2`. The suffix is the file's unit declaration (`units_source = file`). The calendar-date header written with ICALEN = 1 (format 1021) raises."
msgstr "表头（headout.f90，格式 1020）：`LULC  HRU       GIS  SUB  MGT  MON   AREAkm2`，随后每个变量占 10 个字符，先写 SWAT 名称，再接单位后缀，例如 `PRECIPmm`、`SOL_TMPdgC` 或 `SOLARMJ/m2`。后缀即文件的单位声明（`units_source = file`）。ICALEN = 1 写出的日历日期表头（格式 1021）会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:940
msgid "Rows (hrumon.f90, hruyr.f90, and hruaa.f90; formats 1000, 1001, and 2000) are read at their fixed Fortran field positions: HRU as `i5` or `i7`, AREA as `e10.5`, and each value as a 10-character field. Short rows and blank, overflowed (`*`), or non-numeric fields raise."
msgstr "数据行（hrumon.f90、hruyr.f90、hruaa.f90，格式 1000、1001、2000）按 Fortran 固定字段位置读取：HRU 为 `i5` 或 `i7`，AREA 为 `e10.5`，每个数值占 10 字符。短行、空白字段、溢出字段（`*`）或非数值字段均会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:944
msgid "The print settings NBYR, IYR, IDAF, IDAL, IPRINT (0 monthly, 1 daily, 2 annual), NYSKIP, and ICALEN are read from `file.cio` in `root_path` the way SWAT reads that file: by record position, replaying the read statements of readfile.f90. The `value | NAME : description` labels that ArcSWAT and QSWAT write are optional; a label that names a different setting from the one SWAT reads from that record raises. A `file.cio` that ends before ICALEN gives ICALEN = 0, SWAT's initial value; one that ends before a read SWAT requires raises. Without `file.cio`, the settings are declared in `SWATConfig` (`nbyr`, `iyr`, `idaf`, `idal`, `iprint`, `nyskip`, `icalen`). A configured value that differs from `file.cio`, an undeclared setting, and ICALEN = 1 raise. NYSKIP >= NBYR is set to NBYR - 1, as SWAT does."
msgstr "输出设置 NBYR、IYR、IDAF、IDAL、IPRINT（0 为月、1 为日、2 为年）、NYSKIP 和 ICALEN，从 `root_path` 中的 `file.cio` 按 SWAT 自身方式读取：依记录位置，重现 readfile.f90 的读取语句。ArcSWAT 和 QSWAT 写入的 `value | NAME : description` 标签可选；标签指定的设置与 SWAT 从该记录读取的设置不符时会报错。`file.cio` 在 ICALEN 前结束时采用 SWAT 初值 ICALEN = 0；若在 SWAT 必需读取的位置前结束，则报错。无 `file.cio` 时，须在 `SWATConfig` 中声明设置（`nbyr`、`iyr`、`idaf`、`idal`、`iprint`、`nyskip`、`icalen`）。配置值与 `file.cio` 不同、设置未声明或 ICALEN = 1 均会报错。与 SWAT 一致，NYSKIP >= NBYR 时改为 NBYR - 1。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:955
msgid "The CF calendar of the run is always declared in `SWATConfig.calendar` and must give SWAT's year and month lengths. SWAT 2012 uses a leap year when the year is divisible by 4, which is the CF `julian` calendar; `standard` agrees for 1901 to 2099."
msgstr "运行的 CF 日历始终在 `SWATConfig.calendar` 中声明，且必须产生与 SWAT 相同的年和月长度。SWAT 2012 将能被 4 整除的年份视为闰年，对应 CF `julian` 日历；1901 至 2099 年间，`standard` 与其一致。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:959
msgid "SWAT prints only the years after the NYSKIP warm-up years. IDAF applies to the first simulated year and IDAL to the last one (0 means the first or the last day of the year). With IPRINT = 0, each printed year has its monthly blocks followed by one annual block (MON = four-digit year), and the file ends with one average-annual block (MON = years averaged, identified by its position). With IPRINT = 1 there are only daily blocks (MON = julian day). With IPRINT = 2 there is one annual block per printed year and the average-annual block. The file must be exactly the block sequence of the declared settings; any deviation raises."
msgstr "SWAT 仅输出 NYSKIP 个预热年之后的年份。IDAF 作用于首个模拟年，IDAL 作用于最后一个模拟年（0 表示该年的第一天或最后一天）。IPRINT = 0 时，每个输出年先有逐月块，再有一个年度块（MON 为四位年份），文件末尾还有一个多年平均年度块（MON 为平均年数，由位置识别）。IPRINT = 1 时只有逐日块（MON 为年内日序）。IPRINT = 2 时，每个输出年有一个年度块，另有多年平均年度块。文件块序列必须与声明设置完全一致；任何偏差都会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:968
msgid "The records are the monthly or daily blocks (IPRINT 0 or 1) or the annual blocks (IPRINT 2). The summary blocks are excluded from the time series. The dataset attribute `swat_annual_summary_blocks` counts the excluded annual blocks (0 for IPRINT 1 and 2; with IPRINT 2 the annual blocks are the records), `swat_average_annual_summary_blocks` counts the average-annual blocks, and `swat_average_annual_years` is the number of years averaged that the average-annual block gives in its MON field (format f4.1), absent when the file has no such block. Each record carries CF time bounds (`time_bnds`, days since IYR-01-01 in the declared calendar): its calendar month, day, or year, clipped to the simulated window from IDAF to IDAL; the time value is the middle of that interval."
msgstr "记录取自逐月或逐日块（IPRINT 0 或 1），或年度块（IPRINT 2）。汇总块不进入时间序列。数据集属性 `swat_annual_summary_blocks` 统计被排除的年度块（IPRINT 1 和 2 时为 0；IPRINT 2 时年度块本身就是记录），`swat_average_annual_summary_blocks` 统计多年平均年度块，`swat_average_annual_years` 为该块 MON 字段（格式 f4.1）给出的平均年数；文件没有此块时该属性缺失。每条记录携带 CF 时间边界（`time_bnds`，采用声明日历，以 IYR-01-01 以来的天数表示），对应其日历月、日或年，并裁限到 IDAF 至 IDAL 的模拟窗口；时间坐标取该区间中点。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:979
msgid "The mapped SWAT columns are `PRECIP`, `SURQ_GEN`, `LATQGEN`, `ET`, and `SOL_TMP`. The first four are water depths per record and become fluxes over the record bounds: in a year that is not a leap year, 28 mm in February and 31 mm in March are both 1 mm per day (about 1.157e-5 kg m-2 s-1). `SOL_TMP` maps to `soil_temperature`. A date `time_window` raises because the records have a numeric CF time coordinate."
msgstr "映射的 SWAT 列为 `PRECIP`、`SURQ_GEN`、`LATQGEN`、`ET` 和 `SOL_TMP`。前四项为逐记录水深，按记录边界转换为通量：非闰年二月 28 mm 与三月 31 mm 均为每日 1 mm（约 1.157e-5 kg m-2 s-1）。`SOL_TMP` 映射为 `soil_temperature`。日期型 `time_window` 会报错，因为记录使用数值 CF 时间坐标。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:986
msgid "Plugin coupling"
msgstr "插件耦合"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:988
msgid "Plugin coupling is included by `get_available_couplings()` only when the plugin adapter package is importable."
msgstr "插件耦合仅当插件适配器包可导入时才包括在`get_available_couplings()`中。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1007
msgid "`plugin_path` or its `path` alias is required. Missing plugin support raises `RuntimeError`; a missing path raises `ValueError`. A plugin coupling declares the scales it couples: `source_scale`, `target_scale`, and `coupling_type` (`spatial`, `temporal`, `hierarchical`, or `stochastic`) are required config keys; a missing key raises `KeyError`, and another coupling type raises `ValueError`. A plugin adapter still must obey the declared input/output, units, update, state, and execution-group contracts."
msgstr "必须提供 `plugin_path` 或其别名 `path`。缺少插件支持时抛出 `RuntimeError`，缺少路径时抛出 `ValueError`。插件耦合须声明所耦合的尺度：`source_scale`、`target_scale` 和 `coupling_type`（`spatial`、`temporal`、`hierarchical` 或 `stochastic`）均为必需配置键；缺键时抛出 `KeyError`，其他耦合类型抛出 `ValueError`。插件适配器仍须遵守声明的输入/输出、单位、更新、状态和执行组契约。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1016
msgid "Composition rules"
msgstr "组成规则"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1018
msgid "Register coupling Functors through the simulator or GraphIR pipeline."
msgstr "通过 simulator 或 GraphIR pipeline 注册 coupling Functors。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1019
msgid "Declare dependencies through metadata, ports, links, chain maps, or an `IntegrationPlan`."
msgstr "通过声明依赖项metadata端口，链接，链式映射或一个`IntegrationPlan`."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1021
msgid "Do not call another Functor directly from a coupling `forward()` method."
msgstr "不要直接调用另一个Functor从耦合`forward()`方法。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1022
msgid "Route residuals and overflow explicitly; do not silently discard them."
msgstr "显式处理残留物和溢出物； 不要无声地丢弃它们。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1023
msgid "Use `chain_map_check`, `port_matching_check`, and `overflow_routing_check` for structural coupling evidence. These checks validate declarations or supplied samples; they do not evaluate per-step port power or donor/recipient budgets. A closure claim also names the consuming Functor, the single state commit, the unit/support/time basis, and the actual residual; a diagnostic residual discloses an imbalance and does not close it."
msgstr "使用 `chain_map_check`、`port_matching_check` 和 `overflow_routing_check` 提供结构性耦合证据。这些检查验证的是声明或所提供的样本；它们不评估逐步的端口功率，也不评估供体/受体收支。闭合声明还会指明消费方 Functor、唯一的那一次状态提交、单位/支撑域/时间基准以及实际残差；诊断残差只是揭示不平衡，并不能使收支闭合。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/coupling_workflows.md:1029
msgid "Read thresholds and conversion settings through the parameter system."
msgstr "通过参数系统读取阈值和转换设置。"

